                                        "entry_id": "57facfb0-63de-36ea-ace2-4ebbdbd5e2a6",
                                        "glosses": [
                                            "A large drinking vessel, sometimes of pewter, sometimes with a glass base, with one handle and often a hinged cover."
                                        ],
